# kwalla-dance — the names the site reads. Names only: copy this to .env and
# fill in values for local development; in production they are Cloudflare
# Pages environment variables. Both are public. Commented names are
# optional.

# Public iCal address for Kristen's "Where I'll be" Google Calendar: Google
# Calendar → Settings for my calendars → <calendar> → Integrate calendar →
# "Public address in iCal format". The calendar needs Access permissions →
# "Make available to public" ticked, or the URL 404s. Either the webcal://
# or the https:// form; the fetcher normalises it. Unset, the build and the
# endpoint fall back to the seed events in src/data/site.ts.
# PUBLIC_CALENDAR_ICS_URL=

# Origin for canonical and Open Graph URLs. Defaults to site.url in
# src/data/site.ts.
# PUBLIC_SITE_URL=
